{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》隆重舉行，紅地氈環節星光熠熠。一眾當家花旦悉心打扮爭妍鬥麗，其中陳煒、陳自瑤、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳敏之及莊思明均以各具特色的華麗晚裝亮相，成為全場鎂光燈焦點。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>陳煒黑皮晚裝配毛絨披肩 型格與貴氣兼備</strong></b></h2>\n<p>向來散發高貴熟女韻味的陳煒，以一身黑色皮革細肩帶深V晚裝型格登場，貼身剪裁將曼妙身段表露無遺。她雙臂隨性披上黑色毛絨披肩，配襯貼服低髮髻及小巧黑色耳釘，在型格之中增添冬日奢華氣場，狀態大勇。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6223_18729143436afed530e1503-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6223_18729143436afed530e1503-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6221_4199921296afed53396be8-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6221_4199921296afed53396be8-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2><b><strong>陳自瑤蝴蝶結馬甲裙甜美搶鏡 與蕭正楠結伴登場</strong></b></h2>\n<p>同樣選擇黑色戰衣的陳自瑤，與身穿焦糖色西裝配鮮黃色高領內搭的蕭正楠結伴行紅地氈。陳自瑤身穿黑色平口馬甲大擺晚裝，胸前綴以特大立體蝴蝶結，下方更暗藏微鏤空小性感設計。她梳起清爽高丸子頭並配搭銀色長款吊墜耳環，向鏡頭揮手甜笑時少女感十足，甜美又不失女人味。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6554_16450788706afed52eedf5e-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6554_16450788706afed52eedf5e-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6645_20732461966afed52ca9a10-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6645_20732461966afed52ca9a10-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2><b><strong>姚子羚透視黑裙顯知性 傅嘉莉皇家紫蓬裙明豔照人</strong></b></h2>\n<p>另一組焦點落在袁偉豪與兩位花旦姚子羚、傅嘉莉身上。姚子羚身穿全黑高領長袖貼身晚裝，胸前採用薄紗透視拼布，右肩配以立體緞面大蝴蝶結，加上斜分盤髮與水滴形吊墜耳環，盡顯知性優雅；身旁的傅嘉莉則以亮紫色緞面平口抹胸蓬裙搶鏡，修腰馬甲設計襯托出白皙膚色，配搭柔順直長髮及閃耀鑽飾，散發高貴公主氣質。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-5310_2061457786afed535bf5f1-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-5310_2061457786afed535bf5f1-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2><b><strong>陳敏之、莊思明銀色系戰衣閃爆全場</strong></b></h2>\n<p>擁有高挑身段的陳敏之與莊思明不約而同大玩閃亮銀色系造型。陳敏之挽著以黑白西裝配特大白領結亮相的曹永廉登場，身穿銀白色漸變珠片單肩魚尾拖尾長裙，腰側微鏤空與白色緞帶拼接設計盡顯名模級比例；莊思明則與全白西裝造型的楊明同行，一襲銀灰色金屬質感珠片垂墜晚裝高貴大方，為台慶紅地氈增添璀璨星光。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-4502_6350222366afed52a2b381-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-4502_6350222366afed52a2b381-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2><b><strong>龔嘉欣</strong></b></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7039_12161465596afed57bacd37-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7039_12161465596afed57bacd37-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2>張曦雯</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7545_7487858346afed61020432-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7545_7487858346afed61020432-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7705_8934818036afed65917a40-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7705_8934818036afed65917a40-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2>高海寧</h2>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7839_7366846556afed7a226dda-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7839_7366846556afed7a226dda-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8038_13783611256afed7a53b037-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8038_13783611256afed7a53b037-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2>林夏薇</h2>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8148_9225517646afed798a2763-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8148_9225517646afed798a2763-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:16:18.325700+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1001,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:35.366811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:35.366811+00:00","content_hash":"7829b33e75b567bdfe9a20f8c115f0509a3c0981f270b50f071c1ba630ac8820","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}